  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">?	At least 3 SME Capability Centres and at least 3 Innovation Centres will be operational
?	At least 2,000 Syrians under Temporary Protection and host community members will be placed in formal jobs. Out of this total, 1850 will be jobs created through job placements and formalization of informal employment andinnovation programmes while 150 of them will be created through esta ligament of new businesses. (Izmir, Gaziantep, Istanbul, Adana, Hatay, Mersin). ; At least 50% (1,000) of the beneficiaries will be Syrians under Temporary Protection.
?	At least 2,000 Syrians under Temporary Protect and host community members (50-50%) will benefit from awareness raising and other types of business development and employment services, including innovation-driven entrepreneurship;
?	At least 1000 SMEs will benefit from business advisory services in the form of technical assistance and investment/equipment support;
?	At least 150 new SMEs will be established focusing on innovation. Those enterprises will be set-up by Syrians and/or Syrian-Turkish joint ventures.</narrative>
    </description>
